WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.860
Being behind on your bills can be a very scary place

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:10.860
Starting baby step one is a great goal.If you are behind, right now you need to get current on your bills.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.900
Dont even worry about your beginner emergency fund of

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:21.150
$1000. Pay your bills first. You need to take care of what we call the 4 walls. These are basic things we all need.

00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:23.938
food shelter and utilities

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.050
Transportation and

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:30.420
Clothing so what do you do first? Eat, buy food for your family?

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.889
That's the very [first] thing you do the next thing you do is keep the lights and water on

00:00:35.469 --> 00:00:39.569
After paying utilities take care of shelter. that means pay the rent or mortgage.

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:45.989
Then you move on to transportation and once you know [you] can get where you need to go with gas in [the] tank

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:51.659
Then you can take care of your basic clothing needs. don't go all out on brand name fashion

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:53.850
Just buy what you need?

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:57.959
here's a tip don't get behind on your home and be current on your

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:04.199
Mastercard and your student loan if you're going to be behind on something choose to hold off on things [that] don't matter as much

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:09.839
They're called unsecured creditors creditors that don't have any security they don't have a lien on anything

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.590
They're not going to take away basic

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.950
necessities of your life if you have a place to live

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:16.439
It's warm and the lights are on your stomach is full

00:01:16.439 --> 00:01:20.519
And you have clothing to wear and a way to get to work [you] [live] to fight another day

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:22.949
The four Walls are in place and worry

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:27.750
starts to slip away when your lights are about to be cut off but you've paid your mastercard Bill

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.879
That's when life starts spinning out of control

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:37.409
You won't win in that situation put the four walls of your home up first then work your way [through] the other stuff

00:01:37.479 --> 00:01:39.479
It's all about priorities

